config VIDEO_MEDIATEK_VCU_MT8365
	tristate "Mediatek VCU/VPU for MT8365 vendor vcodec (Genio 350)"
	depends on VIDEO_DEV
	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK || COMPILE_TEST
	help
	    Vendor MT8365 (Genio 350) Video Processor Unit / VCU driver.
	    Ported from the mtk-v5.10 BSP. Provides VPU firmware download
	    and the VCU communication channel used by the proprietary
	    userspace (vpud) HW video codec path on MT8365.

	    This builds the mtk-vpu-mt8365 and mtk-vcu-mt8365 modules. The
	    SoC suffix keeps them distinct from mainline's mtk-vpu
	    (drivers/media/platform/mediatek/vpu), which otherwise collides
	    at modules_check when CONFIG_MEDIA_SUPPORT=m.

	    Renamed from the BSP's CONFIG_VIDEO_MEDIATEK_VPU to avoid a
	    symbol collision with mainline's CONFIG_VIDEO_MEDIATEK_VPU
	    (drivers/media/platform/mediatek/vpu).

	    To compile this driver as modules, choose M here.
